# DetectObjectYolo.srv
#
# Separate from DetectObject.srv (which stays exactly as it was, for the
# color-detection path in vision_node.py). This one is for
# vision_detect_node.py, the YOLO-based classification + ArUco-localization
# node.
#
# Place in surgical_msgs/srv/, add to CMakeLists.txt's
# rosidl_generate_interfaces() call alongside the existing srv files, then
# colcon build. Importable as: from surgical_msgs.srv import DetectObjectYolo
#
# No z field: Z comes from pick_place_constants.PICK_Z_M when the coordinator
# builds the pick pose for /execute_task, same convention as DetectObject.srv.

string target_class
---
bool found
float64 x
float64 y
string object_class
float32 confidence
